--TEST--
a `<?= … ?>` hole splits the markup around it into two regions rather than one range spanning it — the bytes in the hole are Novis, and an HTML service asked about them would be answering about a variable
--FILE--
<?nvs
var $name = "world";
?>
<p>hi <?= $name ?>!</p>
--REQUEST--
regions
--EXPECT--
4:1-4:7 html
4:19-5:1 html
